    "treatment_summary": {
     "value": "contact lens holiday and short course of topical corticosteroids (corneal clouding refractory); angiotensin-converting-enzyme inhibitor (lisinopril for renal protection); heart-healthy, calorie-restricted diet for weight loss; low-sodium diet; referred to NIH for possible recombinant human LCAT study, not yet warranted",
     "span": [
      "refractory to a contact lens holiday and a short course of topical corticosteroids",
      "The patient was placed on an angiotensin-converting-enzyme inhibitor, a heart-healthy, calorie-restricted diet for weight loss",
      "lisinopril for renal protection was appropriate",
      "a low-sodium diet to prevent hypertension and further insult to the kidneys",
      "At present, her disease is not severe enough to warrant this therapy"
     ]
